    "message": "I counted every customer by tier and joined their orders with a left join, so customers who never ordered are still counted and add 0 to revenue. Totals are the sum of orders.amount across all order statuses: bronze has 100 customers and 163,987.18 in revenue, gold has 43 and 71,294.79, and silver has 59 and 96,891.01. Six orders have no customer ID and can't be assigned to a tier, so they are left out. No customer is missing a tier. The raw sums had tiny floating-point artefacts (e.g. 163987.1800000001); I show them to the cent."
